# Voice-to-Text Interaction Capture - Implementation Notes

## Completed Tasks

### 1. Whisper Service (Docker)
- Created `whisper-service/` directory with:
  - `Dockerfile` - Python-based container with faster-whisper
  - `requirements.txt` - Dependencies (fastapi, uvicorn, faster-whisper)
  - `app.py` - FastAPI service that loads `base.en` model and exposes `/transcribe` endpoint
- Added `whisper` service to `compose.yml` and `compose.worktree.yml`

### 2. Backend Transcribe Endpoint
- Created `backend/app/api/routes/transcribe.py` with:
  - `POST /transcribe/` endpoint that accepts audio file uploads
  - Proxies requests to Whisper service via internal Docker networking
  - Returns transcribed text, detected language, and duration
- Registered route in `backend/app/api/main.py`

### 3. Frontend Voice Recorder Components
- Created `frontend/src/components/VoiceRecorder/VoiceRecordButton.tsx`:
  - Hold-to-record button using MediaRecorder API
  - Visual feedback (pulsing red while recording, spinner while processing)
  - Supports mouse and touch events for mobile compatibility
  - Sends audio to backend `/api/v1/transcribe/` endpoint

- Created `frontend/src/components/VoiceRecorder/VoiceReviewModal.tsx`:
  - Modal for reviewing/editing transcribed text before saving
  - Pre-populates form with transcribed text
  - Allows selecting attendees, channel, date/time, mood, duration
  - Creates Interaction on confirmation

### 4. Integration
- Added `VoiceRecordButton` to main layout (`frontend/src/routes/_layout.tsx`)
- Added `Mic` and `MicOff` icons to `frontend/src/lib/icons.ts`
- Regenerated API client to include new transcribe endpoint

