## Testing Notes

### Backend
- Backend type checks pass
- Transcribe route loads successfully
- Need to test with actual audio file upload

### Frontend
- TypeScript compilation passes (`bunx tsc --noEmit`)
- Biome lint checks pass
- Component renders in layout with FAB (fixed position bottom-right)

### Infrastructure
- Whisper service uses `base.en` model for speed (142MB download on first run)
- Service exposed on port 8000 internally within Docker network
- No external ports exposed (security)

## Known Issues
- The `whisper-service` needs to be built and started (`just up` should handle this)
- First transcription will be slow as model downloads (~142MB for base.en)
- No audio format validation on frontend (relies on browser MediaRecorder support)

